[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.220",
    "end": "00:00:03.540",
    "start_seconds": 0.22,
    "end_seconds": 3.54,
    "text": "You're going to learn how to say I don't know the right way and maintain"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.540",
    "end": "00:00:05.590",
    "start_seconds": 3.54,
    "end_seconds": 5.59,
    "text": "your credibility in the process."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.900",
    "end": "00:00:08.010",
    "start_seconds": 5.9,
    "end_seconds": 8.01,
    "text": "So here's a situation I've seen numerous times."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.260",
    "end": "00:00:11.120",
    "start_seconds": 8.26,
    "end_seconds": 11.12,
    "text": "A professional shares some important information at a group meeting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.594",
    "end": "00:00:14.204",
    "start_seconds": 11.594,
    "end_seconds": 14.204,
    "text": "or someone is in a public speaking situation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.495",
    "end": "00:00:18.625",
    "start_seconds": 14.495,
    "end_seconds": 18.625,
    "text": "All is going well so far, but once the question and answer period"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:18.625",
    "end": "00:00:21.875",
    "start_seconds": 18.625,
    "end_seconds": 21.875,
    "text": "starts, somebody asks a question and the speaker doesn't know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.875",
    "end": "00:00:24.285",
    "start_seconds": 21.875,
    "end_seconds": 24.285,
    "text": "the answer and they fall apart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.555",
    "end": "00:00:27.734",
    "start_seconds": 24.555,
    "end_seconds": 27.734,
    "text": "They look like a deer stunned in the headlights of a car."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.075",
    "end": "00:00:31.439",
    "start_seconds": 28.075,
    "end_seconds": 31.439,
    "text": "They act like they've been caught and they are very hesitant to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.439",
    "end": "00:00:32.965",
    "start_seconds": 31.439,
    "end_seconds": 32.965,
    "text": "say the words, I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.295",
    "end": "00:00:36.175",
    "start_seconds": 33.295,
    "end_seconds": 36.175,
    "text": "But sometimes that's exactly what you should say."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.395",
    "end": "00:00:40.675",
    "start_seconds": 36.395,
    "end_seconds": 40.675,
    "text": "Saying I don't know is always better than faking it and attempting to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.725",
    "end": "00:00:42.815",
    "start_seconds": 40.725,
    "end_seconds": 42.815,
    "text": "BS your way through the answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.280",
    "end": "00:00:46.870",
    "start_seconds": 43.28,
    "end_seconds": 46.87,
    "text": "If you try to make something up or swerve around the answer, people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.880",
    "end": "00:00:50.810",
    "start_seconds": 46.88,
    "end_seconds": 50.81,
    "text": "will notice and it'll almost always cost you some credibility."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.010",
    "end": "00:00:53.630",
    "start_seconds": 51.01,
    "end_seconds": 53.63,
    "text": "But don't worry, I'm going to show you exactly how to say, I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.090",
    "end": "00:00:57.159",
    "start_seconds": 54.09,
    "end_seconds": 57.159,
    "text": "And you're going to be so smooth by the end of this video, nobody"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.210",
    "end": "00:00:58.740",
    "start_seconds": 57.21,
    "end_seconds": 58.74,
    "text": "will even notice you didn't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.069",
    "end": "00:01:02.449",
    "start_seconds": 59.069,
    "end_seconds": 62.449,
    "text": "I first learned these basic tips that we'll share when I worked for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.450",
    "end": "00:01:04.840",
    "start_seconds": 62.45,
    "end_seconds": 64.84,
    "text": "a longtime mentor, Allen Weiner."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.840",
    "end": "00:01:06.600",
    "start_seconds": 64.84,
    "end_seconds": 66.6,
    "text": "I've mentioned him in a lot of videos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.600",
    "end": "00:01:10.515",
    "start_seconds": 66.6,
    "end_seconds": 70.515,
    "text": "He's the author of So Smart But how intelligent people lose credibility"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.515",
    "end": "00:01:11.725",
    "start_seconds": 70.515,
    "end_seconds": 71.725,
    "text": "and how they can get it back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.145",
    "end": "00:01:14.414",
    "start_seconds": 72.145,
    "end_seconds": 74.414,
    "text": "We're going to use the slice method in this video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.414",
    "end": "00:01:18.375",
    "start_seconds": 74.414,
    "end_seconds": 78.375,
    "text": "The first slice is for beginners, the second slice is an intermediate version,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.414",
    "end": "00:01:22.975",
    "start_seconds": 78.414,
    "end_seconds": 82.975,
    "text": "and the third slice is for advanced application and it is smooth as silk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.415",
    "end": "00:01:25.575",
    "start_seconds": 83.41499999999999,
    "end_seconds": 85.575,
    "text": "Slice 1 is the biggest slice in the video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.824",
    "end": "00:01:28.445",
    "start_seconds": 85.824,
    "end_seconds": 88.445,
    "text": "When you don't know the answer to a question, especially in that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.445",
    "end": "00:01:32.805",
    "start_seconds": 88.445,
    "end_seconds": 92.805,
    "text": "group situation, there are three acceptable ways to say I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.215",
    "end": "00:01:37.485",
    "start_seconds": 93.215,
    "end_seconds": 97.485,
    "text": "One perfectly acceptable answer that will help you maintain your credibility is to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.485",
    "end": "00:01:41.835",
    "start_seconds": 97.485,
    "end_seconds": 101.83500000000001,
    "text": "say some version of, I don't know, but I will look into it and get back to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.935",
    "end": "00:01:44.815",
    "start_seconds": 101.935,
    "end_seconds": 104.815,
    "text": "Or, I don't know, but I'll find out and follow up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.474",
    "end": "00:01:48.395",
    "start_seconds": 105.47399999999999,
    "end_seconds": 108.39500000000001,
    "text": "I've seen this done a thousand times from really confident speakers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.395",
    "end": "00:01:49.275",
    "start_seconds": 108.39500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 109.275,
    "text": "That's how they do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.700",
    "end": "00:01:53.400",
    "start_seconds": 109.7,
    "end_seconds": 113.4,
    "text": "Now, the key with all of these is that you have to maintain your composure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.670",
    "end": "00:01:55.710",
    "start_seconds": 113.67,
    "end_seconds": 115.71000000000001,
    "text": "Don't hesitate or act embarrassed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.980",
    "end": "00:01:58.969",
    "start_seconds": 115.97999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 118.969,
    "text": "So, if somebody asks you a question and you don't know the answer, but"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.969",
    "end": "00:02:03.549",
    "start_seconds": 118.969,
    "end_seconds": 123.549,
    "text": "perhaps you should know the answer based upon your role, you just pause,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.799",
    "end": "00:02:07.189",
    "start_seconds": 123.799,
    "end_seconds": 127.189,
    "text": "think for a moment, and then simply reply with some version of, I don't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.189",
    "end": "00:02:11.210",
    "start_seconds": 127.189,
    "end_seconds": 131.21,
    "text": "know, or I'm not sure, but I'll look into it and come back to you shortly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.690",
    "end": "00:02:14.830",
    "start_seconds": 131.69,
    "end_seconds": 134.83,
    "text": "We're still talking about Slice1, and the next way to say, I don't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.830",
    "end": "00:02:19.430",
    "start_seconds": 134.83,
    "end_seconds": 139.43,
    "text": "know, is to then refer them to somebody who does know the answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.825",
    "end": "00:02:23.945",
    "start_seconds": 139.825,
    "end_seconds": 143.945,
    "text": "There are many situations where somebody may ask you a question that is genuinely"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.984",
    "end": "00:02:28.525",
    "start_seconds": 143.984,
    "end_seconds": 148.525,
    "text": "outside of the scope of your job or outside of the realm of information that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.525",
    "end": "00:02:30.335",
    "start_seconds": 148.525,
    "end_seconds": 150.335,
    "text": "you just delivered in your presentation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.735",
    "end": "00:02:34.875",
    "start_seconds": 150.735,
    "end_seconds": 154.875,
    "text": "You're not expected to know everything just because they're asking you, but"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.895",
    "end": "00:02:38.384",
    "start_seconds": 154.895,
    "end_seconds": 158.38400000000001,
    "text": "if there's someone around that you could refer them to, that's the expert"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.384",
    "end": "00:02:39.554",
    "start_seconds": 158.38400000000001,
    "end_seconds": 159.554,
    "text": "who you want to point them towards."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.584",
    "end": "00:02:43.874",
    "start_seconds": 159.584,
    "end_seconds": 163.874,
    "text": "And it sounds like this, I don't know, but Gary should have that information."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.064",
    "end": "00:02:48.094",
    "start_seconds": 164.064,
    "end_seconds": 168.094,
    "text": "Or I don't know, but I would refer you to Gary who works in that department."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.750",
    "end": "00:02:51.020",
    "start_seconds": 168.75,
    "end_seconds": 171.02,
    "text": "A couple of points of clarification about this one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.310",
    "end": "00:02:54.190",
    "start_seconds": 171.31,
    "end_seconds": 174.19,
    "text": "You want to be sure the person you are mentioning really does know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.190",
    "end": "00:02:57.930",
    "start_seconds": 174.19,
    "end_seconds": 177.93,
    "text": "the answer, or at least they should know the answer better than you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.169",
    "end": "00:03:01.269",
    "start_seconds": 178.16899999999998,
    "end_seconds": 181.269,
    "text": "Do your best to identify the right person for the job, in other words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.600",
    "end": "00:03:04.629",
    "start_seconds": 181.6,
    "end_seconds": 184.629,
    "text": "And if the person is in the room at the time, that's fantastic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.880",
    "end": "00:03:07.689",
    "start_seconds": 184.88,
    "end_seconds": 187.689,
    "text": "Now, on the one hand, they can answer the question right there and then."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.889",
    "end": "00:03:10.620",
    "start_seconds": 187.889,
    "end_seconds": 190.62,
    "text": "On the other hand, make sure you don't throw them under the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:10.630",
    "end": "00:03:12.410",
    "start_seconds": 190.63,
    "end_seconds": 192.41,
    "text": "bus or blame them for anything."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.410",
    "end": "00:03:15.730",
    "start_seconds": 192.41,
    "end_seconds": 195.73,
    "text": "So refer to them in a supportive and in a conversational way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.235",
    "end": "00:03:19.305",
    "start_seconds": 196.235,
    "end_seconds": 199.305,
    "text": "If somebody asks you a question and you believe that Gary might be the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.305",
    "end": "00:03:22.955",
    "start_seconds": 199.305,
    "end_seconds": 202.95499999999998,
    "text": "right person to answer it, you would say respectfully, Is Gary here?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.305",
    "end": "00:03:25.145",
    "start_seconds": 203.305,
    "end_seconds": 205.145,
    "text": "Gary, would you like to answer that question?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.925",
    "end": "00:03:29.094",
    "start_seconds": 205.925,
    "end_seconds": 209.094,
    "text": "And the third way to say I don't know and maintain credibility is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.095",
    "end": "00:03:30.465",
    "start_seconds": 209.095,
    "end_seconds": 210.465,
    "text": "to tell them what you do know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.874",
    "end": "00:03:34.395",
    "start_seconds": 210.874,
    "end_seconds": 214.395,
    "text": "I learned this tip from an old consultant friend of mine, Joe Jokowicz."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.404",
    "end": "00:03:35.375",
    "start_seconds": 214.404,
    "end_seconds": 215.375,
    "text": "So thank you, Joe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.800",
    "end": "00:03:39.710",
    "start_seconds": 215.8,
    "end_seconds": 219.71,
    "text": "There are many occasions where you'll be asked a question that is slightly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.890",
    "end": "00:03:43.650",
    "start_seconds": 219.89,
    "end_seconds": 223.65,
    "text": "off focus or may reflect the other person's agenda a little too much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.850",
    "end": "00:03:47.419",
    "start_seconds": 223.85,
    "end_seconds": 227.41899999999998,
    "text": "Their question may not be as relevant as they're making it sound in the moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.619",
    "end": "00:03:51.060",
    "start_seconds": 227.619,
    "end_seconds": 231.06,
    "text": "In other instances, they may be asking you for data or information that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.060",
    "end": "00:03:54.764",
    "start_seconds": 231.06,
    "end_seconds": 234.764,
    "text": "simply doesn't exist or doesn't exist yet or you don't have access to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.234",
    "end": "00:03:58.755",
    "start_seconds": 235.234,
    "end_seconds": 238.755,
    "text": "In situations like this, you would say, I don't know, but here's what I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.765",
    "end": "00:04:01.515",
    "start_seconds": 238.765,
    "end_seconds": 241.515,
    "text": "do know, or here's what I can tell you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.005",
    "end": "00:04:05.285",
    "start_seconds": 242.005,
    "end_seconds": 245.285,
    "text": "And then you give them the best information that you have, that at"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.285",
    "end": "00:04:07.565",
    "start_seconds": 245.285,
    "end_seconds": 247.565,
    "text": "least somewhat addresses their concern."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.105",
    "end": "00:04:12.145",
    "start_seconds": 248.105,
    "end_seconds": 252.145,
    "text": "So let's say, for example, somebody asks you about the exact sales figures"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.155",
    "end": "00:04:15.175",
    "start_seconds": 252.155,
    "end_seconds": 255.175,
    "text": "for the quarter that just closed, and you don't know the answer to that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.595",
    "end": "00:04:18.954",
    "start_seconds": 255.595,
    "end_seconds": 258.954,
    "text": "You might say, I don't know the exact numbers, but I have heard it was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.954",
    "end": "00:04:21.125",
    "start_seconds": 258.954,
    "end_seconds": 261.125,
    "text": "our strongest quarter in two years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.714",
    "end": "00:04:24.484",
    "start_seconds": 261.714,
    "end_seconds": 264.484,
    "text": "If someone asks, how many people were there last night?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.484",
    "end": "00:04:27.825",
    "start_seconds": 264.484,
    "end_seconds": 267.825,
    "text": "You could say, I don't know how many, but I can tell you it was packed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.825",
    "end": "00:04:29.655",
    "start_seconds": 267.825,
    "end_seconds": 269.655,
    "text": "and there was a line out the door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.135",
    "end": "00:04:34.474",
    "start_seconds": 270.135,
    "end_seconds": 274.474,
    "text": "You notice in my examples, I'm not trying to be argumentative or change the subject."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.784",
    "end": "00:04:36.585",
    "start_seconds": 274.784,
    "end_seconds": 276.585,
    "text": "I'm not trying to dodge the question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.715",
    "end": "00:04:38.375",
    "start_seconds": 276.71500000000003,
    "end_seconds": 278.375,
    "text": "I just don't know the exact answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.715",
    "end": "00:04:42.385",
    "start_seconds": 278.71500000000003,
    "end_seconds": 282.385,
    "text": "So I try to give them something that's valuable that corresponds to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.385",
    "end": "00:04:44.664",
    "start_seconds": 282.385,
    "end_seconds": 284.664,
    "text": "their underlying concern or question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.014",
    "end": "00:04:46.275",
    "start_seconds": 285.014,
    "end_seconds": 286.275,
    "text": "That's when you use this option."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.294",
    "end": "00:04:49.984",
    "start_seconds": 286.294,
    "end_seconds": 289.984,
    "text": "I don't know, but here's what I do know, or here's what I can tell you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.405",
    "end": "00:04:53.825",
    "start_seconds": 290.405,
    "end_seconds": 293.825,
    "text": "So far, that was all Slice 1, the biggest slice of the video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.005",
    "end": "00:04:57.924",
    "start_seconds": 294.005,
    "end_seconds": 297.924,
    "text": "Now let's move on to Slice 2, which is an intermediate way to answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.330",
    "end": "00:05:02.070",
    "start_seconds": 298.33,
    "end_seconds": 302.07,
    "text": "Use this approach if you simply want to avoid saying the actual words"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.070",
    "end": "00:05:03.930",
    "start_seconds": 302.07,
    "end_seconds": 303.93,
    "text": "quote I don't know for some reason."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.210",
    "end": "00:05:06.359",
    "start_seconds": 304.21,
    "end_seconds": 306.359,
    "text": "Maybe you don't like how it sounds or at least you don't want to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.359",
    "end": "00:05:09.860",
    "start_seconds": 306.359,
    "end_seconds": 309.86,
    "text": "say it repetitively if people ask you multiple questions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.080",
    "end": "00:05:13.739",
    "start_seconds": 310.08,
    "end_seconds": 313.739,
    "text": "If that's the case, there are lots of other ways to say that that sound a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.740",
    "end": "00:05:15.300",
    "start_seconds": 313.74,
    "end_seconds": 315.3,
    "text": "little better, but are still honest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.710",
    "end": "00:05:17.030",
    "start_seconds": 315.71,
    "end_seconds": 317.03,
    "text": "Here are some other ways to say it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.690",
    "end": "00:05:19.779",
    "start_seconds": 317.69,
    "end_seconds": 319.779,
    "text": "I haven't seen any data about that yet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.049",
    "end": "00:05:23.710",
    "start_seconds": 320.049,
    "end_seconds": 323.71,
    "text": "Or, I can't be certain because and then fill in the reason."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.110",
    "end": "00:05:28.435",
    "start_seconds": 324.11,
    "end_seconds": 328.435,
    "text": "Or, We'll have that answer by and then give them a time estimate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.855",
    "end": "00:05:31.315",
    "start_seconds": 328.855,
    "end_seconds": 331.315,
    "text": "I'd have to confirm before I comment on that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.235",
    "end": "00:05:35.415",
    "start_seconds": 332.235,
    "end_seconds": 335.415,
    "text": "I don't have that answer right now, but And then you would give"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.415",
    "end": "00:05:37.375",
    "start_seconds": 335.415,
    "end_seconds": 337.375,
    "text": "them whatever answer you did have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.905",
    "end": "00:05:41.144",
    "start_seconds": 337.905,
    "end_seconds": 341.144,
    "text": "In fact, I'll bet as you're watching this right now, you've probably heard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:41.145",
    "end": "00:05:44.825",
    "start_seconds": 341.145,
    "end_seconds": 344.825,
    "text": "other ways to say, I don't know, that sound pretty good to your ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.155",
    "end": "00:05:46.355",
    "start_seconds": 345.155,
    "end_seconds": 346.355,
    "text": "So I have a request."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.685",
    "end": "00:05:51.245",
    "start_seconds": 346.685,
    "end_seconds": 351.245,
    "text": "Do all future viewers a favor of this video and suggest an alternative"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.245",
    "end": "00:05:54.535",
    "start_seconds": 351.245,
    "end_seconds": 354.53499999999997,
    "text": "wording that sounds good to you without saying, I don't know,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.695",
    "end": "00:05:56.335",
    "start_seconds": 354.695,
    "end_seconds": 356.335,
    "text": "sounds supportive, it sounds honest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.345",
    "end": "00:05:59.125",
    "start_seconds": 356.345,
    "end_seconds": 359.125,
    "text": "Put your suggestions in the comments below for everybody to see."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.445",
    "end": "00:06:01.625",
    "start_seconds": 359.445,
    "end_seconds": 361.625,
    "text": "Now here's what to do with these alternative phrases."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.114",
    "end": "00:06:06.804",
    "start_seconds": 362.114,
    "end_seconds": 366.804,
    "text": "If you have an upcoming presentation or group meeting and you anticipate some"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.804",
    "end": "00:06:10.984",
    "start_seconds": 366.804,
    "end_seconds": 370.984,
    "text": "Q& A and you may not know the answer, practice a few of these alternative"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.984",
    "end": "00:06:12.574",
    "start_seconds": 370.984,
    "end_seconds": 372.574,
    "text": "ways to say I don't know aloud."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.684",
    "end": "00:06:14.374",
    "start_seconds": 372.684,
    "end_seconds": 374.374,
    "text": "Have them in your back pocket."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.624",
    "end": "00:06:18.984",
    "start_seconds": 374.624,
    "end_seconds": 378.984,
    "text": "Now I recommend practicing them out loud so they sound fluent and confident"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:18.985",
    "end": "00:06:20.784",
    "start_seconds": 378.985,
    "end_seconds": 380.784,
    "text": "coming out of your mouth in the moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.230",
    "end": "00:06:24.050",
    "start_seconds": 381.23,
    "end_seconds": 384.05,
    "text": "Slice 2 is a little more advanced than Slice 1 because you don't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.050",
    "end": "00:06:27.340",
    "start_seconds": 384.05,
    "end_seconds": 387.34,
    "text": "directly say I don't know, but you're still being honest and truthful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.610",
    "end": "00:06:31.500",
    "start_seconds": 387.61,
    "end_seconds": 391.5,
    "text": "Using different language may help you save face a little bit in the moment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.700",
    "end": "00:06:33.750",
    "start_seconds": 391.7,
    "end_seconds": 393.75,
    "text": "and project confidence as you answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.930",
    "end": "00:06:38.830",
    "start_seconds": 393.93,
    "end_seconds": 398.83,
    "text": "And you can follow up any of those phrases again by saying, I'll follow up with you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.049",
    "end": "00:06:42.270",
    "start_seconds": 399.049,
    "end_seconds": 402.27,
    "text": "Refer them to somebody else who does know or tell them what you do know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.825",
    "end": "00:06:44.125",
    "start_seconds": 402.825,
    "end_seconds": 404.125,
    "text": "And now for Slice 3."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.295",
    "end": "00:06:48.815",
    "start_seconds": 404.295,
    "end_seconds": 408.815,
    "text": "This is a little more advanced, but you can use this advice fairly quickly with a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.815",
    "end": "00:06:51.385",
    "start_seconds": 408.815,
    "end_seconds": 411.385,
    "text": "few minutes of practice on Slice 1 and 2."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.385",
    "end": "00:06:54.574",
    "start_seconds": 411.385,
    "end_seconds": 414.574,
    "text": "And here's the tip for helping you sound as smooth as silk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.005",
    "end": "00:06:58.624",
    "start_seconds": 415.005,
    "end_seconds": 418.624,
    "text": "Skip over the part of the sentence that says, I don't know, altogether."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.855",
    "end": "00:07:01.435",
    "start_seconds": 418.855,
    "end_seconds": 421.435,
    "text": "and just say the second part of your answer."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.655",
    "end": "00:07:04.975",
    "start_seconds": 421.655,
    "end_seconds": 424.975,
    "text": "Here's some earlier examples and we're just going to leave off the statement"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.015",
    "end": "00:07:07.635",
    "start_seconds": 425.015,
    "end_seconds": 427.635,
    "text": "I don't know and say the second part."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.835",
    "end": "00:07:11.115",
    "start_seconds": 427.835,
    "end_seconds": 431.115,
    "text": "You'll see that with some minor adjustments in your wording, this will"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.125",
    "end": "00:07:13.344",
    "start_seconds": 431.125,
    "end_seconds": 433.344,
    "text": "still work great in most situations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.925",
    "end": "00:07:16.495",
    "start_seconds": 433.925,
    "end_seconds": 436.495,
    "text": "I'll have to look into that information and get back to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.415",
    "end": "00:07:19.395",
    "start_seconds": 437.415,
    "end_seconds": 439.395,
    "text": "I'll find you that answer and follow up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.425",
    "end": "00:07:22.065",
    "start_seconds": 440.425,
    "end_seconds": 442.065,
    "text": "Gary should have that information."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.835",
    "end": "00:07:25.315",
    "start_seconds": 442.835,
    "end_seconds": 445.315,
    "text": "I would refer you to Gary who works in that department."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.215",
    "end": "00:07:28.795",
    "start_seconds": 446.215,
    "end_seconds": 448.795,
    "text": "If Gary is here, he's the best person to answer that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.150",
    "end": "00:07:33.200",
    "start_seconds": 450.15,
    "end_seconds": 453.2,
    "text": "I know that it was our strongest quarter in two years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:34.219",
    "end": "00:07:36.930",
    "start_seconds": 454.219,
    "end_seconds": 456.93,
    "text": "I can tell you it was packed and there was a line out the door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.690",
    "end": "00:07:40.650",
    "start_seconds": 457.69,
    "end_seconds": 460.65,
    "text": "And the reason this approach works is that you are still doing your"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.660",
    "end": "00:07:42.860",
    "start_seconds": 460.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 462.86,
    "text": "best to help the other person."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:42.919",
    "end": "00:07:44.110",
    "start_seconds": 462.919,
    "end_seconds": 464.11,
    "text": "It's not a dodge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.209",
    "end": "00:07:47.609",
    "start_seconds": 464.209,
    "end_seconds": 467.609,
    "text": "We may not know the answer, but we're still trying to provide an"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.609",
    "end": "00:07:50.300",
    "start_seconds": 467.609,
    "end_seconds": 470.3,
    "text": "answer that will give them some helpful information or at least"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.310",
    "end": "00:07:51.520",
    "start_seconds": 470.31,
    "end_seconds": 471.52,
    "text": "point them in the right direction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.975",
    "end": "00:07:55.755",
    "start_seconds": 471.975,
    "end_seconds": 475.755,
    "text": "So, even though this entire video is about how to say I don't know and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.755",
    "end": "00:08:00.145",
    "start_seconds": 475.755,
    "end_seconds": 480.145,
    "text": "maintain credibility, there are ways to give an honest answer without having to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.154",
    "end": "00:08:02.365",
    "start_seconds": 480.154,
    "end_seconds": 482.365,
    "text": "always say the actual words every time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.815",
    "end": "00:08:06.754",
    "start_seconds": 482.815,
    "end_seconds": 486.754,
    "text": "I cannot emphasize enough that even though we're really talking about just the words"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.754",
    "end": "00:08:11.495",
    "start_seconds": 486.754,
    "end_seconds": 491.495,
    "text": "you say in this video, your conversational tone, your positive and professional"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.544",
    "end": "00:08:17.135",
    "start_seconds": 491.544,
    "end_seconds": 497.135,
    "text": "attitude will go a long way to projecting confidence and credibility regardless"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.135",
    "end": "00:08:19.125",
    "start_seconds": 497.135,
    "end_seconds": 499.125,
    "text": "of which of these three slices you use."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:19.450",
    "end": "00:08:23.260",
    "start_seconds": 499.45,
    "end_seconds": 503.26,
    "text": "As you practice this on your own, be sure to combine the right words with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:23.270",
    "end": "00:08:25.030",
    "start_seconds": 503.27,
    "end_seconds": 505.03,
    "text": "the right attitude, in other words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.340",
    "end": "00:08:27.630",
    "start_seconds": 505.34,
    "end_seconds": 507.63,
    "text": "Until next time, thanks, God bless, and I'll see you soon."
  }
]
